@prefix : <http://example.org/agora/world/simulation#> .
@prefix actuation: <http://example.org/agora/actuation#> .
@prefix reporting: <http://example.org/agora/reporting#> .
@prefix ag: <http://example.org/agora#> .
@prefix market: <http://example.org/agora/market#> .
@prefix sensing: <http://example.org/agora/sensing#> .

#  The supplier's PRIVATE beliefs — its terms as a genuine seller, not a stake-free utility.
#
#  It composed market:Hosting, actuation:Actuation and — since the barrel learned to run dry —
#  sensing:Listening, so only those modules' terms appear. There is no target here and no
#  cadence: it wants nothing watered, and the one thing it perceives announces on its own clock.

##  market:Hosting — how it runs a round
:supplier
    market:offerQuantityL 2.0 ;      # what it puts up
    market:reservePricePerL 0.20 ;   # its floor; buyers never see the reasoning
    market:bidWindowS 3 ;            # how long it waits for bids before matching
    market:roundCooldownS 30 .       # it will not open rounds faster than this

##  actuation:Actuation — how long it waits for a valve to say it dispensed
#   Added to the open-seconds it computed for that dose, never used alone: a ninety-second
#   pour is not late at thirty. Silence past the deadline is reported and counted, never acted
#   on — the water may well have flowed and only the report been lost.
:supplier actuation:doseGraceS 10 .

##  How often it says how it is — belief base size, reading freshness, silent write failures.
#   Omit this line and the agent reports nothing; see agora/metrics.py.
:supplier reporting:metricsIntervalS 60 .

##  sensing:Listening — the barrel's level sensor announces on its own clock (arc 1), and all
#   a listener states is how long it waits before calling the thing gone quiet.
:supplier sensing:maxReadingAgeS 300 ;
    #  Demanded of every perceiver by the shapes; for a pure listener it has no commanded
    #  interval to be relative to, so it is slack on the announcing clock and nothing more.
    sensing:readingGraceS 45 .

##  No self-review. The world gives this agent no mandate — it holds no revisable
#   setting to be given room on — so it derives no review capability and needs no
#   interval. Compaction still runs: that is the kernel's and not a capability.
